//RS // WebGPU is a browser-owned provider. Native hosts do not expose a standard
//RS // WebGPU ABI, so the production seam reports that fact instead of pretending
//RS // that a CPU result came from a GPU. A browser host can replace this adapter
//RS // at the platform boundary without changing the Core compute contract.
